---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact · Monks Of Market" description="Get in touch with the Monks Of Market team.">
<section class="trust-page" id="contact">
    <div class="shell">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to home</a>
      <header class="trust-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">Corrections &amp; enquiries</div><h1>Contact</h1><p class="trust-lead">Clear reports help improve the calculators. Include the market, exact inputs and the result you expected.</p></div><div class="trust-date">No support form<br>No account required</div></header>
      <div class="trust-layout">
        <nav class="trust-nav" aria-label="Trust pages"><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/" aria-current="page">Contact</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/terms/">Terms</a><a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a></nav>
        <div class="trust-copy">
          <section><h2>How to reach Monks Of Market</h2><p>A dedicated public support address is not currently published on this site. If this tool was shared with you directly, use the same channel for corrections, technical issues or other enquiries. Monks Of Market does not collect messages through the calculator.</p><div class="trust-callout"><strong>Do not send sensitive information</strong>Never include passwords, API keys, brokerage credentials, account numbers, government identifiers, order IDs or full financial statements in a support message.</div></section>
          <section><h2>For a calculation issue</h2><div class="contact-route"><div><b>Include</b><span>Tool name, inputs used, execution-type selections, expected result and device/browser.</span></div><div><b>Exclude</b><span>Login details, exchange API credentials, personal tax records and account screenshots.</span></div></div><p>A reproducible example is more useful than a screenshot alone. If the issue concerns a fee or tax rate, include the official source and its effective date.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Scope of support</h2><p>Questions about how the displayed formulas work, accessibility problems and factual corrections are in scope. Personal investment advice, trade calls, portfolio review, tax filing and account-specific brokerage disputes are not.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Urgent financial or account matters</h2><p>For a live order, missing funds, account restriction, suspicious activity or security issue, contact your broker or exchange through its independently verified official support channel. Monks Of Market cannot access, change or recover a trading account.</p></section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
